  DialogueUI: {fileID: 1353068048649054768}
  Portait: {fileID: 9168999393402796704}
  sentences:
  - "Ah, you're awake\u2014earlier than I expected.  "
  - 'Are you experiencing any discomfort or pain?  '
  - 'My head... My power... Memories...   '
  - 'Spirits... That Monster... My coffin... Where am I?  '
  - 'When I found you in the snow, your body began to glow, and suddenly, we ended
    up here.  '
  - "It's peaceful and soothing here\u2014a good place for you to recover.  "
  - "Wait... that coffin\u2014no, this can't be real.  "
  - 'Please, you need to rest!  '
  - 'Those spirits out there... they''re lost!  '
  - 'I see there''s no convincing you otherwise. At least bring them here; it''s
    safer.  '
